OL,3,GNEWSANew film sees cider mill swap good
OL,4,Aapples for bad
OL,5,
OL,6,FSomerset is known the world over for
OL,7,Fits good cider-making apples, but a new
OL,8,Ffilm set in the county might be about
OL,9,Fto change that.
OL,11,FNew film Bad Apples tells the story of
OL,12,Fa teacher, played by actress Saoirse
OL,13,FRonan, who gets so wound up by an
OL,14,Funruly student at her school that she
OL,15,Fkidnaps and locks him in her basement.
OL,17,FIt was filmed across Somerset and
OL,18,FBristol, and also stars Bristol boy
OL,19,FJacob Anderson and schoolchildren from
OL,20,Fthe area.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
