OL,5,
OL,6,FShowerings Cider Mill in Shepton Mallet
OL,7,Fis one of the locations, despite its
OL,8,Fmanaging director, Matthew Showerings,
OL,9,Fneeding to be convinced to say "yes" to
OL,10,Fthe producers.
